      "id": 1791307762575,
      "userId": 1791306643803,
      "title": "React Notes",
      "content": "<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 39, 47); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Creating&nbsp;and&nbsp;nesting&nbsp;components&nbsp;</strong></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 39, 47); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">React&nbsp;apps&nbsp;are&nbsp;made&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(35, 39, 47); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">components</em><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 39, 47); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.&nbsp;A&nbsp;component&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;piece&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;UI&nbsp;(user&nbsp;interface)&nbsp;that&nbsp;has&nbsp;its&nbsp;own&nbsp;logic&nbsp;and&nbsp;appearance.&nbsp;A&nbsp;component&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;small&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;button,&nbsp;or&nbsp;as&nbsp;large&nbsp;as&nbsp;an&nbsp;entire&nbsp;page.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 39, 47); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">React&nbsp;components&nbsp;are&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;functions&nbsp;that&nbsp;return&nbsp;markup:</span></p><pre data-language=\"plain\">\nfunction MyButton() {\n  return (\n    &lt;button&gt;I&#39;m a button&lt;/button&gt;\n  );\n}\n</pre>",
