      "userId": 1791306643803,
      "title": "Bootstrap 5 Is Evolving With Each",
      "content": "<p>Bootstrap&nbsp;5&nbsp;is&nbsp;evolving&nbsp;with&nbsp;each&nbsp;release&nbsp;to&nbsp;better&nbsp;utilize&nbsp;CSS&nbsp;variables&nbsp;for&nbsp;global&nbsp;theme&nbsp;styles,&nbsp;individual&nbsp;components,&nbsp;and&nbsp;even&nbsp;utilities.&nbsp;We&nbsp;provide&nbsp;dozens&nbsp;of&nbsp;variables&nbsp;for&nbsp;colors,&nbsp;font&nbsp;styles,&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;:root&nbsp;level&nbsp;for&nbsp;use&nbsp;anywhere.&nbsp;On&nbsp;components&nbsp;and&nbsp;utilities,&nbsp;CSS&nbsp;variables&nbsp;are&nbsp;scoped&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;class&nbsp;and&nbsp;can&nbsp;easily&nbsp;be&nbsp;modified.</p>",
