    {
      "userId": 1791306643803,
      "title": "Java Script",
      "content": "<ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Client&nbsp;Side:</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;On&nbsp;the&nbsp;client&nbsp;side,&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;works&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;HTML&nbsp;and&nbsp;CSS.&nbsp;HTML&nbsp;adds&nbsp;structure&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;web&nbsp;page,&nbsp;CSS&nbsp;styles&nbsp;it,&nbsp;and&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;brings&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;life&nbsp;by&nbsp;allowing&nbsp;users&nbsp;to&nbsp;interact&nbsp;with&nbsp;elements&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;page,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;actions&nbsp;on&nbsp;clicking&nbsp;buttons,&nbsp;filling&nbsp;out&nbsp;forms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;showing&nbsp;animations.&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;client&nbsp;side&nbsp;is&nbsp;directly&nbsp;executed&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;user&#39;s&nbsp;browser.</span></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Server&nbsp;Side</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">:&nbsp;On&nbsp;the&nbsp;Server&nbsp;side&nbsp;(on&nbsp;Web&nbsp;Servers),&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;is&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;access&nbsp;databases,&nbsp;file&nbsp;handling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;security&nbsp;features&nbsp;to&nbsp;send&nbsp;responses</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">,</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;to&nbsp;browsers.</span></li></ul>",
