    {
      "userId": 1790871548812,
      "title": "JavaScript",
      "content": "<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">JavaScript&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;programming&nbsp;language&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;dynamic&nbsp;content&nbsp;for&nbsp;websites.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;lightweight,&nbsp;cross-platform,&nbsp;and&nbsp;single-threaded&nbsp;programming&nbsp;language.&nbsp;It&#39;s&nbsp;an&nbsp;interpreted&nbsp;language&nbsp;that&nbsp;executes&nbsp;code&nbsp;line&nbsp;by&nbsp;line,&nbsp;providing&nbsp;more&nbsp;flexibility</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Client&nbsp;Side:</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;On&nbsp;the&nbsp;client&nbsp;side,&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;works&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;HTML&nbsp;and&nbsp;CSS.&nbsp;HTML&nbsp;adds&nbsp;structure&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;web&nbsp;page,&nbsp;CSS&nbsp;styles&nbsp;it,&nbsp;and&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;brings&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;life&nbsp;by&nbsp;allowing&nbsp;users&nbsp;to&nbsp;interact&nbsp;with&nbsp;elements&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;page,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;actions&nbsp;on&nbsp;clicking&nbsp;buttons,&nbsp;filling&nbsp;out&nbsp;forms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;showing&nbsp;animations.&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;client&nbsp;side&nbsp;is&nbsp;directly&nbsp;executed&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;user&#39;s&nbsp;browser.</span></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Server&nbsp;Side</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">:&nbsp;On&nbsp;the&nbsp;Server&nbsp;side&nbsp;(on&nbsp;Web&nbsp;Servers),&nbsp;JavaScript&nbsp;is&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;access&nbsp;databases,&nbsp;file&nbsp;handling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;security&nbsp;features&nbsp;to&nbsp;send&nbsp;responses</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 50, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">,</strong><span style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;to&nbsp;browsers.</span></li></ul>",
